    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38941" root="ملط" body-key="m">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْلَطَتْ</span></b> , (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">املطت جَنِينَهَا</span>, (K.) <i>She</i>
(a camel) <i>cast her fœtus</i> (S, K) <i>before it had
hair growing upon it;</i> (S;) <i>without any hair
upon it:</i> (K:) [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرَطَتْهُ</span>] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّهُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَطَتْهُ</span></b> ,
(K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلُطَ</span></b> , (TA,) <i>she brought it forth in an
imperfect state.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْلَطَ</span> [perhaps a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْلَطَ</span>] <i>He became poor, needy,</i> or
<i>indigent;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْلَصَ</span>. [TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ملص</span>.]

